    "description": "Office Depot\nFelt-Tip Porous Pens\nMedium 1.0mm Point, Assorted Colors\n10\" x 8\" x 3\"\nFactory Sealed\nThis collection of Office Depot brand felt-tip porous pens features a 1.0mm medium point designed for smooth, consistent strokes and crisp lines. The set provides a versatile spectrum of twelve colors, including standard shades and vibrant jewel tones. Engineered for precision, these marker-style pens utilize quick-drying ink that resists smearing, making them ideal for professional writing, color-coding, and creative projects.\nIncludes 12 distinct colors: black, blue, green, lilac, magenta, navy, orange, plum, purple, red, turquoise, yellow\nPrecise marker-style tip ensures durability and ink flow consistency\nFour separate 12-count retail packages, totaling 48 pens\nCondition:\nNew in original retail blister packaging. All four packs are factory sealed with no visible damage or shelf wear. Pens are in pristine, unused condition.\nPlease Note:\nThis is a pre-owned item being sold\nas-is\n. We do our best to describe items accurately and include research where possible, but we are not experts in every category. Please note that if the title or description states \"Tested\" that we only test to make sure the unit \"\nPOWERS ON\"\n.\nNo further testing takes place unless stated otherwise and items are considered untested.\nPlease remember all items are used and are sold as is, no refunds.If you have questions, please contact us before bidding.\nFor all vintage clothing, please research sizing before placing a bid.\nItems from different time periods may have measurements that differ from today’s standard sizing.\nCustomer Service:\nReach us via the “Contact Us” link above or by calling\n(540) 361-6550\n. Messages are handled Monday–Friday, 8:00 AM–4:00 PM ET, and we strive to respond within 48 hours.",
